        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Key rule:&lt;/b&gt; the three specialists are routing targets, not three votes. A requirement is routed to the appropriate specialist; any machine-evaluable checks are delegated to deterministic tools; every specialist result is gated by the Skeptical Verifier before human review." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#667085;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
